===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[deposition]] of [[sediment]] over a long period of time by a [[river]]; an alluvial [[layer]].

====Usage notes====
* The noun is normally used in the plural by [[engineer]]s who recover valuable minerals from these layers.

====Translations====
